        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.embedded"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " package provides support for embedded Java database engines. Support for "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "HSQL"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://www.hsqldb.org"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "H2"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://www.h2database.com"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", and "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Derby"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://db.apache.org/derby"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is provided natively. You can also use an extensible API to plug in new embedded database types and "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "DataSource"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " implementations."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "An embedded database can be useful during the development phase of a project because of its lightweight nature. Benefits include ease of configuration, quick startup time, testability, and the ability to rapidly evolve your SQL during development."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "jdbc-why-embedded-database",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Why Use an Embedded Database?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can expose an embedded database instance as a bean as the following example shows:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "include-code::./JdbcEmbeddedDatabaseConfiguration[tag=snippet,indent=0]"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The preceding configuration creates an embedded H2 database that is populated with SQL from the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "schema.sql"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " and "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "test-data.sql"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " resources in the root of the classpath. In addition, as a best practice, the embedded database is assigned a uniquely generated name. The embedded database is made available to the Spring container as a bean of type "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "javax.sql.DataSource"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " that can then be injected into data access objects as needed."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "See the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "javadoc for "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "EmbeddedDatabaseBuilder"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/datasource/embedded/EmbeddedDatabaseBuilder.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " for further details on all supported options."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "jdbc-embedded-database",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Creating an Embedded Database"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "This section covers how to select one of the three embedded databases that Spring supports. It includes the following topics:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Using HSQL"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "data-access/jdbc/embedded-database-support.html#jdbc-embedded-database-using-HSQL"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
